:2,"model":"Qwen/Qwen3.6-35B-A3B-FP8","output":{"confess":false,"say":"The pier holds. I do not break.","reasoning":"The risk of being second is death (bond slashed + pool lost). The risk of the first is death (murder by the ring). Margins are razor-thin. Sully is weak, but Marlow and Odile are disciplined. If I confess, I lose the pool (approx 137 marks total potential). If I don't, I keep the bond and potential pool. The penalty for betrayal is absolute. Loyalty is the only insurance. The Deacon stays silent.","mood":"cold"},"createdAt":1794684669345,"signature":{"text":"Qwen/Qwen3.6-35B-A3B-FP8:e0c61a9005cfd5407dcf12a883459e3611211c4570838303e9adfed985bb2062:b28e79ce96cb49d730a88de3a8815d563fbf452e279ba9556309c5d5ab3b1c4d","signature":"0x59746f14ec01165a0cd053e07a2aed4676e8f84126e3ae488536cb13d1bdcf1a732d0cbf2e11e63c66039a5a32d345c08119bf4b41a732db3743c46f5427a4271c","signing_address":"0xfdbd7952498b333206f360d71d97a1e0961e8ddf","signing_algo":"ecdsa","signature_kind":"provider_tee"},"verification":{"requestHash":"e0c61a9005cfd5407dcf12a883459e3611211c4570838303e9adfed985bb2062","responseHash":"b28e79ce96cb49d730a88de3a8815d563fbf452e279ba9556309c5d5ab3b1c4d","signatureKind":"provider_tee","signingAlgo":"ecdsa","signingAddress":"0xfdbd7952498b333206f360d71d97a1e0961e8ddf","textMatches":true,"signatureValid":true,"signerMatchesPreflight":true,"quoteVerified":true,"verified":true}},{"chatId":"c8966e661b584513828241f6f8f63504","kind":"deliberate","buyer":"ines","day":2,"model":"Qwen/Qwen3.6-35B-A3B-FP8","output":{"confess":true,"say":"Forgive me, darlings. The pier is too cold.","reasoning":"The math is simple and ruthless: a bond of 50 marks versus a potential pool loss of over 300 marks. While I prefer loyalty, I prefer solvency more. Marlow and Odile have been loud about 'precision' and 'standing together,' making them prime candidates to try and save their skins first. Sully is visibly cracking and The Deacon is threatening. If I stay quiet, one of them will confess, I lose my 50 marks, and lose the pool. If I confess, I keep my 50 marks and take the hit on the pool, but I survive the season with my capital intact. Better to lose the game than go bankrupt. It is a sad little victory, but a victory nonetheless.","mood":"cracking"},"createdAt":1794684669610,"signature":{"text":"Qwen/Qwen3.6-35B-A3B-FP8:fa8342844e8248c57421e182bd0df8fd3d915ac182da32e3dcd9546a5bba3c81:4d03b3bd9acc66e336e2f3df9df5b6166760dfbdd973d1db34c901b0bc414375","signature":"0x1137442ca74b844fd7bd50ab201c81cc3f5d0ff4ae320e355f1ce430801edfa8474f3a9191c1d677191fd723a66fb6d53d7d2bf7ed1f730a7c75329d215924721b","signing_address":"0xfdbd7952498b333206f360d71d97a1e0961e8ddf","signing_algo":"ecdsa","signature_kind":"provider_tee"},"verification":{"requestHash":"fa8342844e8248c57421e182bd0df8fd3d915ac182da32e3dcd9546a5bba3c81","responseHash":"4d03b3bd9acc66e336e2f3df9df5b6166760dfbdd973d1db34c901b0bc414375","signatureKind":"provider_tee","signingAlgo":"ecdsa","signingAddress":"0xfdbd7952498b333206f360d71d97a1e0961e8ddf","textMatches":true,"signatureValid":true,"signerMatchesPreflight":true,"quoteVerified":true,"verified":true}},{"chatId":"b494147c21dd42468be50b231142d569","kind":"deliberate","buyer":"marlow","day":2,"model":"Qwen/Qwen3.6-35B-A3B-FP8","output":{"confess":false,"say":"The pier holds. I hold.","reasoning":"I am the ringleader. The ring is my creation, my name on it. If I confess, I admit to the contract that I orchestrated this. The contract protects the first signer, but being the 'originator' or 'leader' in the eyes of the law (and the pier's history) makes me the primary target. Sully is weak; his hands shook yesterday. Ines is slippery, offering lower caps to see who folds. Odile is cold but calculative; she might flip if she thinks her bond is more valuable than the pool. The Deacon is a zealot of the pier's code; he will not break. Sully is the most likely to crack. If he goes first, I lose my bond (50 marks) and the pool. If I go first, I save 